id: unicode/casing-final-sigma/0001
area: unicode
op: String.prototype.toLowerCase
in: str:"\u03A3"
out: value: str:"\u03C3"
class: normative
prov: spec:es2026@0248456c#sec-string.prototype.tolowercase ref:unicoderef@1 ucd:17.0.0/UnicodeData.txt ucd:17.0.0/SpecialCasing.txt ucd:17.0.0/DerivedCoreProperties.txt
script: "\u03A3".toLowerCase()
note: Final_Sigma: a cased letter and case-ignorables before, and no case-ignorables then a cased letter after; the scans are possessive (section 3.13), and a lone surrogate is neither
