note: ECMA-262's clause defers to ECMA-402's TransformCase, which takes the first requested locale, its Unicode extension removed, matches it by prefix against the languages the UCD has language-sensitive mappings for, and maps by that language: SpecialCasing.txt's conditional lines for tr, az and lt, else the default mapping. Normative, as both engines' plans read it (JSD-0074's case-mapping section, row C9; Broiler.JS's record of SJL-7.1), both engine-level runners' realms having Intl
since: 18

