id: unicode/casing-ceiling/0001
area: unicode
op: String.prototype.toUpperCase, the result's length
in: str:"\u00DF" int:8388608 str:""
out: value: f64:0x4170000000000000
class: normative
prov: spec:es2026@0248456c#sec-string.prototype.touppercase ref:unicoderef@1 ucd:17.0.0/UnicodeData.txt ucd:17.0.0/SpecialCasing.txt
script: ("\u00DF".repeat(8388608)).toUpperCase().length
note: a result of exactly 2^24 code units (correspondence row C12)
since: 18

id: unicode/casing-ceiling/0002
area: unicode
op: String.prototype.toUpperCase, the result's length
in: str:"\u00DF" int:8388608 str:"a"
out: value: f64:0x4170000010000000
class: impl-defined
per-engine.broiler-vm: error: RangeError
prov: spec:es2026@0248456c#sec-string.prototype.touppercase ref:unicoderef@1 ucd:17.0.0/UnicodeData.txt ucd:17.0.0/SpecialCasing.txt
script: ("\u00DF".repeat(8388608) + "a").toUpperCase().length
note: one code unit past 2^24 (correspondence row C12). A string past an engine's own limit may be refused. Broiler.VM's string ceiling is 2^24 code units (StringLengthCeiling), which it passes to the owner as the maximum result length and past which it keeps its RangeError, as JSD-0074 decision 4 has it (and JSD-0070 decision 4 for the ceiling itself); Broiler.JS's ceiling is above it
since: 18

